# Maris3D SLM Blender 0.5B 0.2.2 -- Ollama entry "maris3d-slm-blender-0.5b" (tags :latest and :0.2.2): the base with the 0.2.2 adapter (plans, parts, word edits, talk).
#   ollama create maris3d-slm-blender-0.5b -f Modelfile
#   ollama cp maris3d-slm-blender-0.5b maris3d-slm-blender-0.5b:0.2.2    # the same model under its version tag
# The Maris3D app sends these same settings on every request (src/maris3d/runtimes/ollama.py); they are here
# so a direct call matches. Ollama's own default repeat_penalty (1.1) is not what the adapter was measured with.
FROM ./maris3d-slm-blender-0.5b-q8_0.gguf
ADAPTER ./maris3d-slm-blender-0.5b-v0.2.2-lora-f16.gguf
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER num_predict 1024
# Default system line, used only when a request has no system message (the app always sends its own).
SYSTEM """You are Maris, the Maris3D model by slm4apps. You build and change 3D scenes in Blender from plain words, offline."""
